/-
  EvmAsm.Stateless.SpecRef.PrecompilesBlsMap

  `bls12_map_fp_to_g1` / `bls12_map_fp2_to_g2` of
  `execution-specs/src/ethereum/forks/amsterdam/vm/precompiled_contracts/bls12_381/`
  (`@tests-zkevm@v0.5.0`, `bd8c673`, `bls12_381_g1.py` function
  `bls12_map_fp_to_g1` and `bls12_381_g2.py` function
  `bls12_map_fp2_to_g2`) — the Python delegates to
  `py_ecc.bls.hash_to_curve` (`map_to_curve_G1`/`G2`,
  `clear_cofactor_G1`/`G2`), ported here:

  * `optimized_swu_G1` / `optimized_swu_G2` and `sqrt_division_FQ` /
    `sqrt_division_FQ2` (`py_ecc/optimized_bls12_381/optimized_swu.py`)
  * `iso_map_G1` (11-isogeny) / `iso_map_G2` (3-isogeny), Horner form
  * `clear_cofactor` = `multiply(p, H_EFF_G1/G2)`
    (`py_ecc/optimized_bls12_381/optimized_clear_cofactor.py`)
  * `sgn0` per hash-to-curve draft §4.1
  * all constants emitted mechanically from
    `py_ecc/optimized_bls12_381/constants.py`.
-/

